# Dack Fayden, Helping Hand goads each creature he gives away, and a goaded creature attacks a player other than the one
# who goaded it if able (CR 701.15b). Bot1 gives one Llanowar Elves to Bot2 and one to Bot3, both goaded by Bot1; on
# Bot2's turn 2 its Elves may not attack Bot1, its goader, while Bot3 is there to attack instead - and does, for 1 life.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Dack Fayden, Helping Hand
Island
Island
Forest
Forest
Llanowar Elves
Island
Llanowar Elves
Island x9

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Bot3 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: White)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Dack Fayden, Helping Hand.Cast
Bot1.ChoosePlayer(Bot2)
[T2 Bot2.DeclareAttackers]
! Bot2.Attack(Llanowar Elves > Bot1)
Bot2.Attack(Llanowar Elves > Bot3)
[T2 Bot2.Main2]

[Expect]
Turn = 2
Bot2.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves.GoadedBy = Bot1
Bot2.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves.Tapped = true
Bot1.Life = 20
Bot3.Life = 19
